    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>  <br/><math><mo>(</mo><mn>273</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>269.28</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>1.86</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/><math><mn>3.72</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>1.86</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/>or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>  <br/>Thus, the complex should give two ions in the solution, i.e., the complex will be <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><msub><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> .",
